.TH QUIPU-ALIGN-IMPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-align\-import \- Read external SSSOM as pending proposals without accepting mappings or writing facts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu align import\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIset.sssom.tsv\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read external SSSOM as pending proposals without accepting mappings or writing facts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIset.sssom.tsv\fR>

